# Innkeeper's Talent at level 3: "If you would put one or more counters on a permanent or player, put twice that many of
# each of those kinds of counters on that permanent or player instead." Esper Origins's flashback puts its card onto the
# battlefield transformed with a finality counter, and the Saga enters with a lore counter (CR 714.3a): both are counters it
# enters with, put on it by its controller (CR 122.6, 122.6a), so the replacement doubles both as part of the one entry
# (CR 614.1c) - two finality counters and two lore counters. Two lore counters trigger chapters I and II at once (CR 714.2b):
# Llanowar Elves, on top, are revealed and put into the hand, and {G}{G} is added, which casts them with {G} left over.

